{%- comment -%}
===============================================================================
  MyFrequentRewards — lifecycle email system v6
  -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Template   : 01. Verify email & set password
  File       : respondent.liquid
  Class      : Auth (transactional — no unsubscribe)
  Trigger    : New respondent registered; email not yet verified
  Tone       : welcome
  Replaces   : respondent.liquid

  SUBJECT LINES — pick one, or A/B them
    1. Verify your email to activate your MyFrequentRewards account
    2. {{ user.name.first }}, one step left to activate your account
    3. Confirm your email address and set your password

  PREHEADER
    Confirm your address and choose a password. The link is valid for 24 hours.

  PRIMARY CTA
    Verify my email address  ->  set-password?user=…&code=…

  PLAIN-TEXT ALTERNATIVE
    dist/text/respondent.txt — send as the text/plain part of a multipart message.
    HTML-only mail is scored down by most spam filters.

  Generated from react/src/emails/01-respondent.jsx — edit the JSX and re-run
  `npm run build`. Hand edits to this file are overwritten.

  Images are served from the base configured at build time; upload assets/
  there before sending. Serve over HTTPS from a stable path — clients do not
  retry a 404, so a moved asset breaks every copy already delivered.
===============================================================================
{%- endcomment -%}
